{
  "voice_id": "voice-03",
  "alignment": "one-clip-one-shot-one-caption",
  "slowdown_allowed": false,
  "max_speedup_factor": 1.55,
  "shots": [
    {
      "id": "S01",
      "narration_id": "N01",
      "text": "雨后的水踰洞，连着两起死亡。金素英，二十岁。",
      "start": 0.0,
      "duration": 5.0,
      "source_seconds": 5.503,
      "natural_clip_seconds": 5.25,
      "natural_speech_seconds": 5.14,
      "spoken_seconds": 4.79,
      "tempo_factor": 1.0746,
      "speech_start": 0.03,
      "speech_end": 4.82,
      "characters": 18,
      "target_chars_per_second": 3.6
    },
    {
      "id": "S02",
      "narration_id": "N01",
      "text": "三月，检方公开了她的姓名、年龄和照片。",
      "start": 5.0,
      "duration": 5.0,
      "source_seconds": 4.516,
      "natural_clip_seconds": 4.27,
      "natural_speech_seconds": 4.16,
      "spoken_seconds": 4.16,
      "tempo_factor": 1.0,
      "speech_start": 5.03,
      "speech_end": 9.19,
      "characters": 16,
      "target_chars_per_second": 3.2
    },
    {
      "id": "S03",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "text": "最早的一杯饮料，在南杨州咖啡馆外，递给了她当时的男友。",
      "start": 10.0,
      "duration": 7.0,
      "source_seconds": 6.0,
      "natural_clip_seconds": 5.55,
      "natural_speech_seconds": 5.44,
      "spoken_seconds": 5.44,
      "tempo_factor": 1.0,
      "speech_start": 10.03,
      "speech_end": 15.47,
      "characters": 24,
      "target_chars_per_second": 3.429
    },
    {
      "id": "S04",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "text": "2025年12月14日，南杨州咖啡馆外，男友喝下饮料后昏迷。",
      "start": 17.0,
      "duration": 7.0,
      "source_seconds": 6.095,
      "natural_clip_seconds": 5.85,
      "natural_speech_seconds": 5.74,
      "spoken_seconds": 5.74,
      "tempo_factor": 1.0,
      "speech_start": 17.03,
      "speech_end": 22.77,
      "characters": 27,
      "target_chars_per_second": 3.857
    },
    {
      "id": "S05",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "text": "两天后，他醒来，分手后报案。线索浮出水面。",
      "start": 24.0,
      "duration": 6.0,
      "source_seconds": 5.0,
      "natural_clip_seconds": 4.87,
      "natural_speech_seconds": 4.76,
      "spoken_seconds": 4.76,
      "tempo_factor": 1.0,
      "speech_start": 24.03,
      "speech_end": 28.79,
      "characters": 17,
      "target_chars_per_second": 2.833
    },
    {
      "id": "S06",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "text": "他活了下来。可屏幕上的红光，没有熄灭。",
      "start": 30.0,
      "duration": 5.0,
      "source_seconds": 4.899,
      "natural_clip_seconds": 4.6,
      "natural_speech_seconds": 4.49,
      "spoken_seconds": 4.49,
      "tempo_factor": 1.0,
      "speech_start": 30.03,
      "speech_end": 34.52,
      "characters": 16,
      "target_chars_per_second": 3.2
    },
    {
      "id": "S07",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "text": "1月28日，水踰洞。认识不久、不是男友的男子，随她走进旅馆。",
      "start": 35.0,
      "duration": 7.0,
      "source_seconds": 6.827,
      "natural_clip_seconds": 6.58,
      "natural_speech_seconds": 6.47,
      "spoken_seconds": 6.47,
      "tempo_factor": 1.0,
      "speech_start": 35.03,
      "speech_end": 41.5,
      "characters": 25,
      "target_chars_per_second": 3.571
    },
    {
      "id": "S08",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "text": "饭后，是她提出去旅馆。门，在两人身后轻轻合上。",
      "start": 42.0,
      "duration": 7.0,
      "source_seconds": 6.734,
      "natural_clip_seconds": 6.44,
      "natural_speech_seconds": 6.33,
      "spoken_seconds": 6.33,
      "tempo_factor": 1.0,
      "speech_start": 42.03,
      "speech_end": 48.36,
      "characters": 19,
      "target_chars_per_second": 2.714
    },
    {
      "id": "S09",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "text": "警方认为，她选的不是偶遇地点，而是封闭、私密的空间。",
      "start": 49.0,
      "duration": 6.0,
      "source_seconds": 6.4,
      "natural_clip_seconds": 6.1,
      "natural_speech_seconds": 5.99,
      "spoken_seconds": 5.79,
      "tempo_factor": 1.0426,
      "speech_start": 49.03,
      "speech_end": 54.82,
      "characters": 22,
      "target_chars_per_second": 3.667
    },
    {
      "id": "S10",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "text": "两小时后，她独自离开。次日，那名男子死亡。",
      "start": 55.0,
      "duration": 5.0,
      "source_seconds": 5.3,
      "natural_clip_seconds": 5.06,
      "natural_speech_seconds": 4.95,
      "spoken_seconds": 4.76,
      "tempo_factor": 1.0378,
      "speech_start": 55.03,
      "speech_end": 59.79,
      "characters": 17,
      "target_chars_per_second": 3.4
    },
    {
      "id": "S11",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "text": "2月9日，第二名二十多岁男子，和她进了同区旅馆。",
      "start": 60.0,
      "duration": 7.0,
      "source_seconds": 6.014,
      "natural_clip_seconds": 5.71,
      "natural_speech_seconds": 5.6,
      "spoken_seconds": 5.6,
      "tempo_factor": 1.0,
      "speech_start": 60.03,
      "speech_end": 65.63,
      "characters": 21,
      "target_chars_per_second": 3.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S12",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "text": "他也不是男友。警方封锁现场；两人的姓名职业没有公开。",
      "start": 67.0,
      "duration": 7.0,
      "source_seconds": 5.968,
      "natural_clip_seconds": 5.63,
      "natural_speech_seconds": 5.52,
      "spoken_seconds": 5.52,
      "tempo_factor": 1.0,
      "speech_start": 67.03,
      "speech_end": 72.55,
      "characters": 23,
      "target_chars_per_second": 3.286
    },
    {
      "id": "S13",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "text": "两次短暂约会里，他们都替她付了饭钱和房费。",
      "start": 74.0,
      "duration": 6.0,
      "source_seconds": 4.516,
      "natural_clip_seconds": 4.36,
      "natural_speech_seconds": 4.25,
      "spoken_seconds": 4.25,
      "tempo_factor": 1.0,
      "speech_start": 74.03,
      "speech_end": 78.28,
      "characters": 19,
      "target_chars_per_second": 3.167
    },
    {
      "id": "S14",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "text": "警方认为，她接近这些男人，是为了满足消费。",
      "start": 80.0,
      "duration": 5.0,
      "source_seconds": 4.133,
      "natural_clip_seconds": 3.84,
      "natural_speech_seconds": 3.73,
      "spoken_seconds": 3.73,
      "tempo_factor": 1.0,
      "speech_start": 80.03,
      "speech_end": 83.76,
      "characters": 18,
      "target_chars_per_second": 3.6
    },
    {
      "id": "S15",
      "narration_id": "N05",
      "text": "检方认为，冲突或索取回报出现时，她试图控制对方。",
      "start": 85.0,
      "duration": 6.0,
      "source_seconds": 5.793,
      "natural_clip_seconds": 5.53,
      "natural_speech_seconds": 5.42,
      "spoken_seconds": 5.42,
      "tempo_factor": 1.0,
      "speech_start": 85.03,
      "speech_end": 90.45,
      "characters": 21,
      "target_chars_per_second": 3.5
    },
    {
      "id": "S16",
      "narration_id": "N05",
      "text": "她却说，自己怕身体接触，只想让他们睡过去。",
      "start": 91.0,
      "duration": 6.0,
      "source_seconds": 4.7,
      "natural_clip_seconds": 4.39,
      "natural_speech_seconds": 4.28,
      "spoken_seconds": 4.28,
      "tempo_factor": 1.0,
      "speech_start": 91.03,
      "speech_end": 95.31,
      "characters": 18,
      "target_chars_per_second": 3.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S17",
      "narration_id": "N05",
      "text": "她说没想杀人。可这个解释，开始被证据推开。",
      "start": 97.0,
      "duration": 6.0,
      "source_seconds": 6.432,
      "natural_clip_seconds": 6.18,
      "natural_speech_seconds": 6.07,
      "spoken_seconds": 5.81,
      "tempo_factor": 1.0439,
      "speech_start": 97.03,
      "speech_end": 102.84,
      "characters": 18,
      "target_chars_per_second": 3.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S18",
      "narration_id": "N05",
      "text": "记录显示，她事前反复确认：这样做，可能致命。",
      "start": 103.0,
      "duration": 5.0,
      "source_seconds": 5.375,
      "natural_clip_seconds": 5.2,
      "natural_speech_seconds": 5.09,
      "spoken_seconds": 4.78,
      "tempo_factor": 1.0665,
      "speech_start": 103.03,
      "speech_end": 107.81,
      "characters": 18,
      "target_chars_per_second": 3.6
    },
    {
      "id": "S19",
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "text": "男友昏迷之后，她没有停下；同样的风险，越过下一扇门。",
      "start": 108.0,
      "duration": 6.0,
      "source_seconds": 5.84,
      "natural_clip_seconds": 5.66,
      "natural_speech_seconds": 5.55,
      "spoken_seconds": 5.55,
      "tempo_factor": 1.0,
      "speech_start": 108.03,
      "speech_end": 113.58,
      "characters": 22,
      "target_chars_per_second": 3.667
    },
    {
      "id": "S20",
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "text": "鉴定、轨迹、聊天记录，扣成两起死亡的证据链。",
      "start": 114.0,
      "duration": 6.0,
      "source_seconds": 5.41,
      "natural_clip_seconds": 5.275,
      "natural_speech_seconds": 5.21,
      "spoken_seconds": 5.21,
      "tempo_factor": 1.0,
      "speech_start": 114.03,
      "speech_end": 119.24,
      "characters": 18,
      "target_chars_per_second": 3.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S21",
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "text": "一审法院认为，她知道风险，却仍然继续。",
      "start": 120.0,
      "duration": 5.0,
      "source_seconds": 4.307,
      "natural_clip_seconds": 4.09,
      "natural_speech_seconds": 3.98,
      "spoken_seconds": 3.98,
      "tempo_factor": 1.0,
      "speech_start": 120.03,
      "speech_end": 124.01,
      "characters": 16,
      "target_chars_per_second": 3.2
    },
    {
      "id": "S22",
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "text": "明知可能死亡，仍任由它发生——未必故意。",
      "start": 125.0,
      "duration": 5.0,
      "source_seconds": 5.027,
      "natural_clip_seconds": 4.68,
      "natural_speech_seconds": 4.57,
      "spoken_seconds": 4.57,
      "tempo_factor": 1.0,
      "speech_start": 125.03,
      "speech_end": 129.6,
      "characters": 16,
      "target_chars_per_second": 3.2
    },
    {
      "id": "S23",
      "narration_id": "N07",
      "text": "法院认定，驱使她的主因不是爱情，而是经济和消费贪欲。",
      "start": 130.0,
      "duration": 7.0,
      "source_seconds": 5.793,
      "natural_clip_seconds": 5.53,
      "natural_speech_seconds": 5.42,
      "spoken_seconds": 5.42,
      "tempo_factor": 1.0,
      "speech_start": 130.03,
      "speech_end": 135.45,
      "characters": 23,
      "target_chars_per_second": 3.286
    },
    {
      "id": "S24",
      "narration_id": "N07",
      "text": "过度警惕、回避冲突、缺乏共情，也让关系失了衡。",
      "start": 137.0,
      "duration": 7.0,
      "source_seconds": 6.014,
      "natural_clip_seconds": 5.85,
      "natural_speech_seconds": 5.74,
      "spoken_seconds": 5.74,
      "tempo_factor": 1.0,
      "speech_start": 137.03,
      "speech_end": 142.77,
      "characters": 19,
      "target_chars_per_second": 2.714
    },
    {
      "id": "S25",
      "narration_id": "N07",
      "text": "没有性侵或强迫迹象。“只是防身”，法院没有采信。",
      "start": 144.0,
      "duration": 6.0,
      "source_seconds": 4.818,
      "natural_clip_seconds": 4.6,
      "natural_speech_seconds": 4.49,
      "spoken_seconds": 4.49,
      "tempo_factor": 1.0,
      "speech_start": 144.03,
      "speech_end": 148.52,
      "characters": 19,
      "target_chars_per_second": 3.167
    },
    {
      "id": "S26",
      "narration_id": "N08",
      "text": "三月，她被起诉。8月27日，法庭判处无期徒刑。",
      "start": 150.0,
      "duration": 6.0,
      "source_seconds": 6.5,
      "natural_clip_seconds": 6.19,
      "natural_speech_seconds": 6.08,
      "spoken_seconds": 5.81,
      "tempo_factor": 1.0456,
      "speech_start": 150.03,
      "speech_end": 155.84,
      "characters": 19,
      "target_chars_per_second": 3.167
    },
    {
      "id": "S27",
      "narration_id": "N08",
      "text": "法庭还命令她接受三十年电子定位监管。",
      "start": 156.0,
      "duration": 6.0,
      "source_seconds": 4.598,
      "natural_clip_seconds": 4.45,
      "natural_speech_seconds": 4.34,
      "spoken_seconds": 4.34,
      "tempo_factor": 1.0,
      "speech_start": 156.03,
      "speech_end": 160.37,
      "characters": 17,
      "target_chars_per_second": 2.833
    },
    {
      "id": "S28",
      "narration_id": "N08",
      "text": "检方曾求死刑。8月28日，她先提出上诉。",
      "start": 162.0,
      "duration": 6.0,
      "source_seconds": 5.201,
      "natural_clip_seconds": 4.93,
      "natural_speech_seconds": 4.82,
      "spoken_seconds": 4.82,
      "tempo_factor": 1.0,
      "speech_start": 162.03,
      "speech_end": 166.85,
      "characters": 17,
      "target_chars_per_second": 2.833
    },
    {
      "id": "S29",
      "narration_id": "N09",
      "text": "9月2日，检方也上诉。案件，仍在二审。",
      "start": 168.0,
      "duration": 6.0,
      "source_seconds": 5.12,
      "natural_clip_seconds": 4.91,
      "natural_speech_seconds": 4.8,
      "spoken_seconds": 4.8,
      "tempo_factor": 1.0,
      "speech_start": 168.03,
      "speech_end": 172.83,
      "characters": 15,
      "target_chars_per_second": 2.5
    },
    {
      "id": "S30",
      "narration_id": "N09",
      "text": "门关上了，红光还亮着。审判仍在继续。",
      "start": 174.0,
      "duration": 6.0,
      "source_seconds": 5.4,
      "natural_clip_seconds": 4.98,
      "natural_speech_seconds": 4.87,
      "spoken_seconds": 4.87,
      "tempo_factor": 1.0,
      "speech_start": 174.03,
      "speech_end": 178.9,
      "characters": 15,
      "target_chars_per_second": 2.5
    }
  ],
